{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7KhcR2jfo2dLkheg8Y4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft this, a few questions. Your answers will change what the pitch says.\n\n1. **What exactly are you asking the public for?** I'm reading it as $60,000 from the crowd plus $25,000 from the bank, making $85,000. Is that right? And if you miss June 30, does everyone get their money back automatically, like last time?\n2. **What's different from the failed campaign?** Anyone who gave three years ago will remember the refund. I can see some differences already: a smaller target, the $1 lease, and the bank's pledge. Is there more? For example, did the $120,000 plan include costs you've since dropped, did the owner's terms change, or have you learned something about how you're running the campaign?\n3. **How will the cinema pay its way once it's open?** Backers will want to know the money buys a cinema that stays open, not one that closes again in two years. Do you have running costs, ticket prices, or a break-even figure? Is 180 tickets a week enough? And why did it close in 2022?\n4. **What do backers get?** Reward tiers, founding memberships, seat plaques, free tickets, or nothing beyond the cinema reopening.\n5. **Who signs it, and where does it run?** Your name and title, the group's name, the cinema's name, the platform, and a target opening date if you have one.\n6. **Is there anything a reader might find out that isn't in your list?** For example, costs beyond the $85,000 such as licensing, insurance or film rental, the roof estimate going up, or someone in town who opposes the project.\n\nIf you don't know some of these, just say so. I'll write around the gaps and won't guess."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":734,"cache_read_input_tokens":9519,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":734},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d19f40c6-de8b-4f2f-8d29-a351301333ef","uuid":"cdbdb8c9-aa9d-444a-861c-8cda19f6fbf2","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:33:16.501Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7KhcCNzEsvQbXPdZ4bu"}
